<%# Above a page drawn again for a form the server refused (SubmissionsController): that the form was not sent, and each refusal as a link to its field, the same words that sit under the field. A visitor who sent the form from far down the page reads it first, and a screen reader announces it (role="alert"). errors: one { id:, label:, message: } per refused field, in the form's order. Its id has an underscore, which no section anchor can hold. -%>
<%= tag.div(class: "sw-errors", id: "form_errors") do %><div class="sw-inner"><div class="sw-errors-box" role="alert"><h2>Your form was not sent</h2><ul><%= safe_join(errors.map { |error| tag.li(tag.a(error[:label].present? ? "#{error[:label]}: #{error[:message]}" : error[:message], href: "##{error[:id]}")) }) %></ul></div></div><% end %>
